    <section class="section" id="features">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Important updates, delivered clearly</h2>

        <p>
          NOTIFY is designed to help students notice new learning information
          without having to constantly check their Moodle accounts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>

        <div>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Multi-channel notifications</h3>
            <p>
