              and coursework updates on your phone.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div id="security">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Account-conscious design</h3>
            <p>
              Student account access and privacy are important considerations
              as the project's technical approach is developed.
            </p>
