    </section>


    <section class="section" id="how-it-works">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>How the programme will work</h2>

        <p>
          A simple proposed flow for notifying students about Moodle activity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="how-panel">

        <div>

          <div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <div class="step-number">1</div>
              <h3>Create a NOTIFY account</h3>
              <p>Students sign up or log in to their NOTIFY account.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <div class="step-number">2</div>
              <h3>Connect Moodle</h3>
              <p>
                Students provide the appropriate access through a secure
                method that the project will define.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <div class="step-number">3</div>
              <h3>Check course activity</h3>
              <p>
                NOTIFY detects whether new content or unread updates are available.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <div class="step-number">4</div>
              <h3>Send a phone alert</h3>
              <p>
                New information is surfaced in the student's phone notification panel.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section" id="about">

      <div>

        <div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>About the programme</h2>
          </div>

          <p style="color:var(--muted)!important;line-height:1.8;">
            This programme was created to help describe new information uploaded
            on the UCU Moodle website. Students can miss coursework marks or
            important academic updates when they do not notice newly uploaded
            materials. NOTIFY is an idea for bringing updates from Moodle to
            students' notification panels, making important course information
            easier to notice among everyday social media notifications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="solutions">

          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Current situation</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="current-note">
            NOTIFY is currently a project concept. The team is still exploring
            the best logic and technical approach to make the programme work
            as expected. Dashboard items and alert examples on this page are
            illustrative, not live Moodle notifications.
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


